ordering_evidence":"zhulv-q-977d6762294ac7ae1407","source_order":[56,150,84],"order":10001},{"id":"yululu-e-5bfa295e35c42a52226c","title":"孙河为县长时吾粲为小吏，河深奇之","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-5bfa295e35c42a52226c","label":"正文","text":"孙河为县长时吾粲为小吏，河深奇之","evidence":["yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0040","role":"奇赏","evidence":["yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0087","role":"为小吏","evidence":["yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589","order":10246},{"id":"yululu-e-38e96d176176eb81ad7e","title":"孙河后为将军，表吾粲为曲阿丞；迁长史，治有名迹","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-38e96d176176eb81ad7e","label":"正文","text":"孙河后为将军，表吾粲为曲阿丞；迁长史，治有名迹","evidence":["yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0040","role":"表任","evidence":["yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0087","role":"受任","evidence":["yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144","order":10247}],"persons":[{"id":"sunshi-p0040","name":"孙河","evidence":["sunshi-q-o024","zongshi-q-dab771f32de31e194c3d","zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac","zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938","zongshi-q-8ee96a90fb85ca176f95","zongshi-q-13cdcc8a099ae7b41751","zongshi-q2-0416008ba004d21bf070","zongshi-q2-32910f7e512dbabc034d","zhulv-q-977d6762294ac7ae1407","feipin-q-7aed1d8c9b523e023a4e","yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589","yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144","yululu-q-e6d7f4552ca4be9f3fb2"],"facts":[{"id":"zongshi-f2-a2772bf4133c26d6feb1","text":"领左右兵，典知内事；从孙策平定吴、会。","evidence":["zongshi-q2-0416008ba004d21bf070"]},{"id":"zongshi-f2-6c67b80cc45b41150a88","text":"《吴书》记四子：助、谊早卒，助为曲阿长，谊为海盐长；桓有学行，受擢并在华容讨关羽，诱其余党五千。","evidence":["zongshi-q2-32910f7e512dbabc034d"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"sunshi-m-o024-sunshi-p0040","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-o024"]},{"id":"yululu-m-925604b96a79a73245b5","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及孙河，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-e6d7f4552ca4be9f3fb2"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-7aed1d8c9b523e023a4e","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-913913df849dedebb73d","layer":"original","quote":"孙策与孙河、吕范，依景，合众共讨泾县山贼祖郎；郎败走。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":111,"end":138},{"id":"sunshi-e-o024c-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d67845c3617c1902ff74","layer":"original","quote":"徐州牧陶谦深忌策〖6〗。策舅吴景，时为丹杨太守〖7〗；策乃载母，徙曲阿，与吕范、孙河俱就景〖8〗，因缘召募得数百人〖9〗。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":139},{"id":"sunshi-q-o024","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-d67845c3617c1902ff74","layer":"original","quote":"策字伯符。坚初兴义兵，策将母，徙居舒〖1〗。与周瑜相友〖2〗，收合士大夫；江、淮间人咸向之。﹝一﹞坚薨，还葬曲阿〖3〗；已〖4〗，乃渡江居江都〖5〗。﹝二﹞徐州牧陶谦深忌策〖6〗。策舅吴景，时为丹杨太守〖7〗；策乃载母，徙曲阿，与吕范、孙河俱就景〖8〗，因缘召募得数百人〖9〗。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":139},{"id":"yululu-q-077c4d79e48d5843a589","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-79dea07027e2a2ad41a0","layer":"original","quote":"孙河为县长，粲为小吏，河深奇之","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":442,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":31},{"id":"yululu-q-8953011467b73ec72144","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-79dea07027e2a2ad41a0","layer":"original","quote":"河后为将军，得自选长吏〖1〗，表粲为曲阿丞〖2〗。迁为长史〖3〗，治有名迹","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":442,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":69},{"id":"yululu-q-e6d7f4552ca4be9f3fb2","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-79dea07027e2a2ad41a0","layer":"original","quote":"吾粲字孔休，吴郡乌程人也。﹝一﹞孙河为县长，粲为小吏，河深奇之。河后为将军，得自选长吏〖1〗，表粲为曲阿丞〖2〗。迁为长史〖3〗，治有名迹。虽起孤微〖4〗，与同郡陆逊、卜静等比肩齐声矣。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":442,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93},{"id":"zhulv-q-977d6762294ac7ae1407","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-46033b4e233de3d8a67f","layer":"original","quote":"时唯范与孙河常从策〖8〗，跋涉辛苦，危难不避。策亦〔以〕亲戚待之，每与升堂，饮宴于太妃前","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":84,"end":128},{"id":"zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"及翊遇害，河驰赴宛陵〖7〗；责怒览、员以不能全（权）〔翊〕〖8〗，令使奸变得施","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":117},{"id":"zongshi-q-13cdcc8a099ae7b41751","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-40267110d0c4533e8a07","layer":"pei","quote":"从权讨李术，术破，拜威寇中郎将，领庐江太守","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-48f4c5f1183bed08eabe","start":86,"end":107},{"id":"zongshi-q-8ee96a90fb85ca176f95","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-40267110d0c4533e8a07","layer":"pei","quote":"少从坚征讨，常为前驱","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-48f4c5f1183bed08eabe","start":48,"end":58},{"id":"zongshi-q-dab771f32de31e194c3d","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-90dd64e5e37cb3798323","layer":"original","quote":"孙策爱之，赐姓为孙，列之属籍","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":38},{"id":"zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"二人议曰：“伯海与将军疏远〖9〗，而责我乃（耳）〔尔〕〖10〗；讨虏若来〖11〗，吾属无遗矣〖12〗！”遂杀河，使人北迎扬州刺史刘馥〖13〗；令住历阳，以丹杨应之","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":118,"end":199},{"id":"zongshi-q2-0416008ba004d21bf070","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-40267110d0c4533e8a07","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《吴书》曰：“河，坚族子也。出后姑俞氏，后复姓为孙。河质性忠直，讷言敏行；有气干，能服勤。少从坚征讨，常为前驱。后领左右兵，典知内事：待以腹心之任。又从策平定吴、会。从权讨李术，术破，拜威寇中郎将，领庐江太守。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-48f4c5f1183bed08eabe","start":0,"end":109},{"id":"zongshi-q2-32910f7e512dbabc034d","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-e7fb17449a292b283909","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《吴书》曰：“河有四子：长助，曲阿长；次谊，海盐长：并早卒。次桓，仪容端正，器怀聪朗，博学强记，能论议应对。权常称为宗室颜渊，擢为武卫都尉。从讨关羽于华容，诱羽余党；得五千人，牛马、器械甚众。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-60d3b3002c6de9511eac","start":0,"end":100}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
